Package: eivfin
Type: Package
Title: Errors-in-Variables Regression Models with Applications in Finance
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("ErkinD", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "73018025+erkind@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Fits errors-in-variables (measurement error) regression models.
    Provides total least squares (orthogonal regression) with bootstrap
    covariance estimation and Deming regression with a known error variance
    ratio and jackknife standard errors. Both return 'eivfit' objects with
    conventional coef(), vcov(), confint() and summary() methods. Worked
    examples illustrate attenuation bias in financial beta estimation.
